  "sourceText": "Raisin Dumplings\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, February 13, 2010 - 7:51am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup flour\n3 teaspoons baking powder\n1 teaspoon salt\n1 tablespoon butter\ncup raisins or currants\ncup dry bread, crumbled\n1 egg\ncup milk\n2 teaspoons onion\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix flour, powder, salt, and butter. Add remaining, mix only to moisten the dough. Drop by small amounts into hot soup.",
